<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>Creating a Private View</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='italic' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>NOTE: Although this Help document was created specifically for the Hecs Orders database and includes examples from the HECS Orders database, the procedure is similar for any Notes database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1. Launch the HECS Orders database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2. Select a "template view"</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	2.1 The database contains many views.  Some views can be seen in the navigator pane, on the left-hand-side of the screen.  Others can only be seen by clicking on "View" (on the top menu bar), then "Go To".</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
