</jpeg></picture><run><font name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4. Customizing the Private View</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>You can customize the view in several ways as shown below.  When you are done changing the view, remember to save it,.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	4.1 easy stuff:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>		4.1.1 to delete a column, right-click on the column header and select Cut from the pop-up menu</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>		4.1.2 to change the format of a column, double-click on the column title.  The Column Dialog Box will appear, allowing you to change:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			- column title</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			- justification/alignment</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			- number format</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			- sorting type</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	4.2 harder stuff: adding a column</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>		4.1 Add a column</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.1.1 right-click on the column header next to the place where you want the new column to be inserted</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.1.2 select "Insert Column" from the pop-up menu</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>		4.2 assign meaningful data to that new column</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.2.1 Click on the header of the new column, so that it is highlighted</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.2.2 In the box on the bottom,right of the screen, select Display Field</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.2.3  Select the field you want from the list that appears under the Display Field option</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>			4.2.4 Click on the Refresh button to refresh the view and determine whther the field was the correct one.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run><picture
 width='699px' height='652px'><jpeg>
